@startuml SystemContext
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Traveler / Frontline Users" as Users
actor "Guest / Viewer" as Guest
actor "Creator / Contributor" as Creators

package "Frontline App" {
  [Trip Management]
  [Spot & Review UI]
  [Story / Social Layer]
  [Recommendation Client]
}

package "Back Office System" {
  [Moderation & Curator Dashboard]
  [Data Integration & ETL]
  [Recommender Lab]
  [Analytics & Admin]
}

Users --> [Trip Management] : create/edit trips
Users --> [Spot & Review UI] : submit reviews, create spots
Creators --> [Story / Social Layer] : publish stories
Guest --> [Story / Social Layer] : view shared story

[Spot & Review UI] --> [Moderation & Curator Dashboard] : submit content (pending)
[Trip Management] --> [Data Integration & ETL] : sync metadata (optional)
[Story / Social Layer] --> [Analytics & Admin] : engagement events
[Recommendation Client] <..> [Recommender Lab] : recommendation signals / model updates
[Data Integration & ETL] --> [Spot & Review UI] : provide authoritative place data
[Moderation & Curator Dashboard] --> [Spot & Review UI] : publish/approve content
[Analytics & Admin] --> [Frontline App] : aggregate metrics, reward events

note bottom
This context diagram shows main data flows:
- UGC flows from Frontline to Back Office for moderation & integration.
- Curated/verified data and recommender outputs flow back to Frontline.
end note
@enduml
